  "release_notes_3_15_4": "Model v3.15.4 (v5.4-pareto, software 3.15.4) replaced the legacy 2,800-line Stage-2 heuristic cascade with clean regularized V4/V5 neural + sparse combiners. Legacy heldout_20261026 scores stepped back from v3.12.0 while fresh zero-overlap sealed R22-live accuracy jumped +8.20 pp (prod) and +20.57 pp (combined).",
  "release_notes_3_17_0": "Model v3.17.0 (clean-sheet 4-plane hybrid, software 3.17.0) replaced the remaining 98 MB V4/V5 .npz combiner/specialist tables with a 100% torch-free, 0-.pkl pure-ONNX tri-encoder + GBDT meta-stacker (283.1 MiB live production RSS, -76.6% vs v3.15.4, 4.80x faster live inference). On legacy heldout_20261026, Audio language (+1.34 pp to 92.65%) and Anime detection (+2.01 pp to 92.85%) improved over v3.15.4, while on fresh firewalled R26-live (N=3,104) v3.17.0 beat v3.15.4 across all core pillars (+2.38 pp prod, +2.87 pp combined, +1.96 pp clean-10, +2.45 pp strict P(x) audio, +4.05 pp adult/XXX, and 91.7% fewer clean false positives)."
